//! The bench/diagnostic counter statics of [`AllocCore`] — the 15
//! always-compiled process-wide statics (`DECOMMIT_CALLS` ..
//! `PROMOTION_BYTES_HIST`), the `promotion_byte_bucket` histogram-bucket fn,
//! the `FOREIGN_OR_UNROUTABLE_FREES` stat static, and the
//! `LargeCacheHitCounter` alias — mechanically split out of the former flat
//! `alloc_core.rs` body (the face group's 1000-line cap). The definitions are
//! byte-identical to their pre-split forms; consumers reach them through the
//! `alloc_core` group re-exports (visibility/cfg parity), so every pre-reorg
//! `alloc_core::alloc_core::<name>` path stays valid.

